<section class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Equipment</div>
        <h1>Terrarium &amp; aquarium equipment</h1>
        <p>
          Everything you need to keep reptiles and aquatic animals properly -
          lighting, heating, food, substrates and decoration.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="intro">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="intro-box">
          <div class="eyebrow">Our range</div>
          <p>
            We stock <strong>Arcadia</strong> and
            <strong>HabiStat</strong> equipment - UVB and spot lighting,
            heaters, supplements and food for geckos and tortoises, as well as
            live feeders (dubia and feeder roaches) always in stock. For
            terrarium decoration we carry natural substrates, stone and décor.
